<Events>
    <!--Campaign: Amthor. Created by Sil taTener-->
	<Warlord side="1" name="Silanda" city="Skyvine" level="10" portrait="12" major="3" minor="3">
		<Unit id="0" type="55" level="4" name="Ulhnga"/>
		<Unit id="1" type="56" level="6" name="Thanior"/>
		<Unit id="2" type="57" level="7" name="Blakur"/>
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="2" name="Thurna" city="Myrryn" level="7" portrait="21" major="3" minor="1">
	</Warlord>


	<Warlord side="3" name="Karlout" city="Starhaven" level="8" portrait="11" major="1" minor="0">
		<Unit id="0" type="5" level="5" name="Kharal"/>
		<Unit id="1" type="5" level="7" name="Thoran"/>
		<Unit id="2" type="4" level="6" name="Siltro"/>
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="4" name="Draknor" city="Khaz-Dhorlikh" level="12" portrait="08" major="2" minor="1">
	</Warlord>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1">
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="1"/>
		<Message>After you have secured the supply of the troops, you prepare the attack on Khaz Agar. Your scouts report that Prince Agnoril has become the new King of Khaz Agar. He has assambled two mighty elementar beside him. You hear the rumour that the two elementars are invincible twins.|You need to get more information about the old legend of the twin elementar. A rash attack could lead to ruin, so you curb your anger and send your troops to the city Skyvine of the elves in the north west. Surely in the fabled library a book exists about the old legend. But the elves will never voluntarily admit a descendant of the dwarves.</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="eq1"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="war1"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1">
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="3"/>
		<Message>Your scouts report that troops of Khaz Agar and the Sirian Knights are assembled in the west. Take care that you do not get caught between two fronts.</Message>
	</Event>

    <!--Elementar Quest City Skyvine-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Message>You have managed to enter the library of Skyvine. Your scouts have found a book about the twin Elementar, but it is written in an old Elven language. Maybe Siantra could translate it for you.|Continue with Amthor 04.</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to enter the library of Skyvine. Your scouts have found a book about the twin Elementar, but it is written in an old Elven language. Maybe Siantra could translate it for you. You send an envoy to her.</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>


	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to enter the library of Skyvine. But you could not find a book about the legend.| Your scouts report an Archon, which has fled onto the open sea.</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>


    <!--Elementar Quest City Myrryn-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Message>You have managed to enter the library of Myrryn. Your scouts have found a book about the twin Elementar, but it is written in an old Elven language. Maybe Siantra could translate it for you.|Continue with Amthor 04.</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to enter the library of Myrryn. Your scouts have found a book about the twin Elementar, but it is written in an old Elven language. Maybe Siantra could translate it for you. You send an envoy to her.</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>


	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You enter the library of Myrryn. But you could not find a book about the legend.| Only the library of Skyvine holds a book about the twin Elementar.</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Warlords quest Dwarves-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to kill the leader of the Dwarves. The pursuers have been repelled.|Continue with Amthor 04.</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to kill the leader of the Dwarves. The pursuers have been repeled.</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="war2"/>
		<Message>You have managed to kill the leader of the Dwarves. That will surely weaken your pursuers.</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Warlords quest Knights-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="31">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="31"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to kill the leader of the Knights. The pursuers have been repelled.|Continue with Amthor 04.</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="31">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="31"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to kill the leader of the Knights. The pursuers have been repelled.</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="31">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="31"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="war1"/>
		<Message>You have managed to kill the leader of the Knights. That will surely weaken the pursuers.</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Win Option-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="99" location="city" locdata="5">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>Continue with Amthor 04.</Message>
		<Action type="victory" data1="0"/>
	</Event>

</Events>
